--!strict
--[[
	Enemies (section 9). Every enemy of the floors 1 to 10 bestiary plus the ten field bosses, as
	`Types.EnemyDef` rows keyed by PascalCase id. An enemy is an archetype (behavior, telegraph
	timing, Guard Gauge) plus a skin (rig id and shatter) plus a floor tier (numbers).

	Numbers in a row are TIER-1 BASE VALUES. `Enemies.scaled(def)` applies the floor's tier from
	tiers.luau (and the field-boss multiplier); `Enemies.variant(def, kind)` applies the Elite,
	Night or Gilded rules on top. EnemyService spawns from those copies, never from the raw row.
	Floor 1 rows are tier 1, so for the Phase 0 slice the raw numbers are the final numbers.

	Telegraphs follow the archetype table: Charger 0.6 s crouch (red line on the ground: the rush
	is Unblockable, so it is sidestepped, never guarded or parried), Brute 1.0 s overhead (yellow),
	Skirmisher 0.4 s dip (white), Lancer 0.7 s draw-back (red line), Swarm 0.3 s hiss, Guard a
	0.5 s shield bash, Caster-beast 1.2 s inhale (red cone), Stalker 0.3 s shimmer,
	Warden-construct 1.0 s pillar glow (red circle). Every wind-up is at least
	combat.telegraphMinWindUp.

	Attack `clip` is the bare clip name; the full id is enemy/<skin>/<clip>. Only the Boar and
	Kobold rigs exist in Phase 0; every other skin is listed in `Enemies.placeholderRigs`.

	Phase 0 tuning (level-1 player, Trialist Sword attack 18, STR 10, a tier-1 Art at 1.0):
	one hit does 18 * 1.12 - defense = 18.2 to the boar (120 HP: 7 hits) and 16.2 to the kobold
	(190 HP: 12 hits). The spec says 6 to 8 and 10 to 14; tests/data/enemies.spec.luau checks it.
]]

local Types = require(script.Parent.Parent.types)
local Combat = require(script.Parent.combat)
local Tiers = require(script.Parent.tiers)

export type VariantKind = "Elite" | "Night" | "Gilded"

export type Enemy = Types.EnemyDef & {
	packSize: number?, -- Swarm groups, wolf packs, lion prides; default 1
	arts: { string }?, -- humanoids with Arts execute these player Art ids with their own clips
	mirrorShield: boolean?, -- carries a Mirror Shield (every Elite, mini-boss and boss)
	fieldBoss: boolean?, -- section 9 field boss: 4x Elite stats, 90-minute respawn, Apex piece at 15%
	gilded: boolean?,
	guaranteedRare: boolean?,
	variant: VariantKind?,
	description: string?, -- skin notes for the modeler
}

